DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45668::$$$message_0435_0000_0000$$$::"So this is the Holy Grail Onsen... Not bad! It'll make good material for my next travel column!"::
45669::$$$message_0435_0000_0001$$$::"Kariya, aren't you going to get undressed? Sakura and I are both ready..."::
45671::$$$message_0435_0000_0003$$$::"Y-yeah. Go ahead and get in first. I still need to mentally prepare."::
45672::$$$message_0435_0000_0004$$$::"I see. Then with your leave... Let's go, Sakura. [wvl][hfsigh layer=2] Away!"::
45673::$$$message_0435_0000_0005$$$::"Away."::
45674::$$$message_0435_0000_0006$$$::"Now...[wvl canskip=false time=400][hffacechg2 chara=雁夜 face=真剣2 pos=winner time=300 textclear=0] An onsen that grants wishes... I hope it's real. Please let it be real."::
45675::$$$message_0435_0000_0007$$$::"But what should I wish for? A happy life with Aoi... Oh, but I don't have money for the wedding... I wonder if the onsen can make me rich..."::
45676::$$$message_0435_0000_0008$$$::"Or maybe I can make Zouken suffer in hell... But I feel like the old fox would manage to crawl his way back..."::
45677::$$$message_0435_0000_0009$$$::"No, why don't I solve the root of all the problems? A more attractive Kariya Matou... Won't that make everything go better?[wvl canskip=false time=300][hffacechg2 chara=雁夜 face=驚き2 pos=winner time=300 textclear=0][hfchance layer=2]...Wait, what the hell am I thinking!?"::
45678::$$$message_0435_0000_0010$$$::"I have to build a future with Aoi myself. Right now, the most precious thing to me is..."::
45679::$$$message_0435_0000_0011$$$::"...Sakura. That's right. I need to make Sakura happy as soon as I can!"::
45680::$$$message_0435_0000_0012$$$::"Okay, I've got it! I'm going to wish for Sakura to meet someone who makes her happy!"::
45681::$$$message_0435_0000_0013$$$::"Ahhh, what a nice hot spring... I can feel my worries melting away."::
45682::$$$message_0435_0000_0014$$$::"An onsen that grants wishes... The sales pitch was genuine."::
45683::$$$message_0435_0000_0015$$$::"..."::
45684::$$$message_0435_0000_0016$$$::"Thanks for waiting! I'm gonna dive into the onsen now!"::
45686::$$$message_0435_0000_0018$$$::"GAAAHHHHH! A-a million volts!?"::
45687::$$$message_0435_0000_0019$$$::"What's happening!? Hang in there, Kariya! Why did you suddenly blast out of the water like a rocket launcher as soon as you got in!?"::
45688::$$$message_0435_0000_0020$$$::"If all you ever have is excessive Skills like that, you'll lose sight of what's important, you know."::
45689::$$$message_0435_0000_0021$$$::"W-what kind of Skill does that...? Are you two okay? Someone electrified the water...[wvl][quake time=2000 vmax=25 hmax=25][hfangry layer=2][se storage=SE_0009.wav][seloop storage=SE_0017.wav][se storage=se05053.wav][fg left=0 index=600000 top=0 time=10 storage=white opacity=255 layer=4][move time=70 path=(0,0,150)(0,0,0)(0,0,150)(0,0,0)(0,0,150)(0,0,0) storage=white accel=0 layer=4]Guuuaaaargh!"::
45690::$$$message_0435_0000_0022$$$::"It should just be a normal onsen! But why do you keep sticking your limbs in it!? Do you only know how to walk in a straight line!?"::
45691::$$$message_0435_0000_0023$$$::"I don't like the pain, either! But...but...![wvl][quake time=2000 vmax=25 hmax=25][hfangry layer=2][se storage=SE_0009.wav][seloop storage=SE_0017.wav][se storage=se05053.wav][fg left=0 index=600000 top=0 time=10 storage=white opacity=255 layer=4][move time=70 path=(0,0,150)(0,0,0)(0,0,150)(0,0,0)(0,0,150)(0,0,0) storage=white accel=0 layer=4] YEEEEAAARGH!"::
45692::$$$message_0435_0000_0024$$$::"Kariya! What's happening!? What are you wishing for!?"::
45693::$$$message_0435_0000_0025$$$::"Oh... Could this be..."::
45694::$$$message_0435_0000_0026$$$::"The onsen...feels nice... I'm sure the part about wishes is a lie... But if it isn't..."::
45695::$$$message_0435_0000_0027$$$::"...Yeah. Then I wish my frail uncle can be a little healthier..."::
45697::$$$message_0435_0000_0029$$$::"...The water has become a medicine that's good for the body now... So it must be poisonous to the bugs inside him..."::
45698::$$$message_0435_0000_0030$$$::"Guh, argh...Wh-why does it hurt so much!?[wvl][quake time=2000 vmax=25 hmax=25][hfangry layer=2][se storage=SE_0009.wav][seloop storage=SE_0017.wav][se storage=se05053.wav][fg left=0 index=600000 top=0 time=10 storage=white opacity=255 layer=4][move time=70 path=(0,0,150)(0,0,0)(0,0,150)(0,0,0)(0,0,150)(0,0,0) storage=white accel=0 layer=4] I...I need to save SakuraaaaAAAARGH!"::
45700::$$$message_0435_0000_0032$$$::"It's an infinite loop! I know this, Kariya! This is called an infinite loop, correct!?"::
45701::$$$message_0435_0000_0033$$$::"..."::
45702::$$$message_0435_0000_0034$$$::"I'm sorry, Uncle Kariya. And...thank you."::
45703::$$$message_0435_0000_0035$$$::"You did just spin your wheels again this time... But I hope something nice happens to you someday..."::

